SGS) to conduct rigorous human efficacy patch tests and hair loss improvement evaluations, ensuring you have factual data to back your brand&#8217;s claims.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Q4: Can you manufacture the product if I provide my own core anti-hair loss ingredients (client-supplied materials)?<\/strong> A4: Absolutely. We support this OEM processing model. However, to ensure the safety and stability of the final product, the raw materials you provide must come with a complete MSDS (Material Safety Data Sheet), COA (Certificate of Analysis), and relevant compliance documents. Our R&amp;D team will first conduct compatibility and stability tests using your ingredients before moving to mass production.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Q5: Do your production cleanrooms meet export standards?<\/strong> A5: Completely. We operate a 100,000-class GMPC dust-free production facility and are fully certified under the ISO 22716 international quality system. Whether you are targeting the domestic market or exporting to North America, Europe, or Southeast Asia, our production environment and quality control systems meet the strict regulatory requirements of those regions, and we can assist in providing the necessary export qualification documents.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>In the global beauty and personal care market, one specific segment is rising at an astonishing pace: the anti-hair loss and scalp care market. With the acceleration of modern lifestyles, surging work stress, and shifting dietary habits, &#8220;hair loss&#8221; is no longer an exclusive concern for the middle-aged and elderly. An increasing number of Millennials [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2422,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_joinchat":[],"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4482","post","type-post","